<title>USA: Mirage Resorts sets $250 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Mirage Resorts sets $250 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Mirage Resorts Inc was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER MIRAGE RESORTS INC</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	  COUPON 7.25 PCT   MATURITY 11/01/2006</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	    ISS PRICE 99.869  MAKE-WHOLE CALL AT</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA2     YIELD 7.268 PCT     +15 BASIS POINTS</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS   SPREAD +73 BP</p>
<p>-- Corporate bond Unit 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
